WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.962
Today we will explore repeated structure through weaving. Our work connects with

00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:06.152
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.913
Lay parallel paper strips on a desk as the base.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.465
Pass one strip over then under the base strips.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.740
Repeat the sequence and straighten the finished pattern. Explain one respectful

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.735
similarity or difference with another African example.
